[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0010","text":"恶魔太郎！ 恶魔太郎！ 恶魔太郎！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0020","text":"……！　１秒……不到……！\n这样的话，可以许３次愿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0030","text":"嘿嘿……所以，\n恶魔太郎，来家里了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_9999","text":"大崎家的父亲\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0040","text":"你们俩开始齐声喊恶魔太郎的时候，我还以为出什么事了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_9998","text":"大崎家的母亲\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0050","text":"呜呜……今天又不是露营地……\n会打扰到邻居的……所以只能在心里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0060","text":"嘿嘿……\n小甜，好狡猾……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0070","text":"你们几个，时间差不多了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0080","text":"……啊，快看……！\n流星……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0090","text":"……真的有……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0100","text":"哇…………\n好厉害……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0110","text":"呵呵……\n来来，大家。许愿了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0120","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0130","text":"嘿嘿……／嘻嘻……／呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0140","text":"……今天，\n是在住宅区里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0150","text":"要在，心里许愿吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0160","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0170","text":"流星，只有1秒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0180","text":"在那期间"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0190","text":"许3次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_99_0200","text":"…………"}]
